function uploadFile(){const input=el('#upload-file'),f=input?.files?.[0],category=el('#upload-category')?.value;if(!f)return notify('Selecione um arquivo.');if(f.size>15*1024*1024)return notify('Arquivo maior que 15 MB. Use um PDF menor.');(async()=>{try{app.busy=true;notify('Lendo arquivo...');let content='';if(/\.pdf$/i.test(f.name)||f.type==='application/pdf'){try{const m=await import('https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf.js/4.8.69/pdf.min.mjs');m.GlobalWorkerOptions.workerSrc='https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf.js/4.8.69/pdf.worker.min.mjs';const pdf=await m.getDocument({data:new Uint8Array(await f.arrayBuffer())}).promise;for(let p=1;p<=Math.min(pdf.numPages,120);p++){const page=await pdf.getPage(p),t=await page.getTextContent();content+=`\n[Página ${p}]\n`+t.items.map(x=>x.str).join(' ')+'\n';}content=content.slice(0,200000)}catch(e){notify('PDF armazenado. Extração indisponível; tente com internet ou cole o texto.') }}else content=(await f.text()).slice(0,200000);
const id=crypto.randomUUID?.()||String(Date.now());await putFile(id,f);state.documents.push({id,name:f.name,subject:category,size:f.size,text:content,updatedAt:Date.now()});save();scheduleSync();notify('Material adicionado à biblioteca.');render();}catch(e){notify('Não foi possível adicionar o arquivo: '+e.message)}finally{app.busy=false}})()}
function savePaste(){const name=el('#paste-name').value.trim(),tx=el('#paste-text').value.trim();if(!name||!tx)return notify('Preencha nome e conteúdo.');state.documents.push({id:crypto.randomUUID?.()||String(Date.now()),name,subject:'Texto adicionado',size:tx.length,text:tx.slice(0,200000),updatedAt:Date.now()});save();scheduleSync();notify('Texto salvo.');render()}
let dbPromise;
const db=()=>dbPromise||(dbPromise=new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{if(!('indexedDB'in window))return reject(Error('IndexedDB indisponível'));const req=indexedDB.open('ufms_files_v1',1);req.onupgradeneeded=()=>{req.result.createObjectStore('files')};req.onsuccess=()=>resolve(req.result);req.onerror=()=>reject(req.error)}));
const putFile=async(id,f)=>{try{const d=await db();await new Promise((res,rej)=>{const t=d.transaction('files','readwrite'),r=t.objectStore('files').put(f,id);r.onsuccess=()=>res();r.onerror=()=>rej(r.error)})}catch(e){console.warn('IndexedDB',e)}};
const getFile=async(id)=>{const d=await db();return new Promise((res,rej)=>{const r=d.transaction('files','readonly').objectStore('files').get(id);r.onsuccess=()=>res(r.result);r.onerror=()=>rej(r.error)})};
const deleteFile=async(id)=>{try{const d=await db();d.transaction('files','readwrite').objectStore('files').delete(id)}catch{}};
